    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d309">

                <pb facs="0348" n="272" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg272"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 351.117/87</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Ambassador Sharp </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 26, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1575. Your despatch 3231, May 25, concerning Armand Garrot. Upon mother’s urgent
                    request and statement that son has broken leg and tuberculosis, renew request
                    for his release.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
